- app/ is built with Termux's terminal-emulator and terminal-view
  (https://github.com/termux/termux-app) and Termux:API
  (https://github.com/termux/termux-api), and parts of it follow their
  code (the key handling, the extra keys, the RUN_COMMAND and am socket
  protocols, the compat classes in app/termux-shared-compat).
